# The Way Agency — URL Redirect Map
# Old Webflow URLs → New URLs (301 permanent redirects)
# Deployed alongside the site on Cloudflare Pages
#
# Every destination is the FINAL, extensionless URL (/contact, /personal/home,
# /about/): Pages 308-redirects /x.html to /x, so a .html destination costs a
# second hop. scripts/validate-build.js fails on a .html or /index.html
# destination, on a destination another rule redirects again (multi-hop), and
# on a destination that is not a built page (TECH-07).
# Never add a rule between /path/slug and /path/slug.html (either direction):
# Pages already serves /path/slug from slug.html, and such a rule loops.
# Only redirect when the OLD slug differs from the NEW slug.
# Put static rules ABOVE any splat (*) rule that also matches them: the
# top-most matching rule wins.
#
# Host canonicalisation (thewayagency.com and thewayagency-site.pages.dev ->
# https://www.thewayagency.com) is a Cloudflare Bulk Redirect on the account,
# not a rule here: Pages _redirects cannot redirect by host, and ignored the
# host rule that used to sit here.

